      "description": "The user is projecting themselves onto the visual entity of the woman in the wine aisle, interpreting her as a representative of the stereotyped 'basic white girl' as described in the top text. The meme's framing implies that the user sees themselves or identifies with this stereotype, or is mocking it from a self-referential perspective. The projection is onto the VisualMaterial entity 'woman' and is reinforced by the textual material 'basic white girl in her natural habitat', which directly labels the visual entity.",
